From: verkur46 <mohamadrezasahami1999@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 01:07:40 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 022/230] Remove the live pitch view and the 2D match replay
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Delete LivePitch, ReplayPitch, PitchArt and the pitch/replay model libs,
the /match/:id/replay route (with its legacy redirect), the
GET /api/matches/:id/replay endpoint, the replay scrubber and tactical-view
CSS, the replay page skeleton and transport icons, the three test suites and
their runner wiring, and the replay.* / live.* / shot.play i18n keys in both
EN and FA.

Match detail keeps the timeline/predict/stats/lineups/ratings tabs with no
gap where the pitch sat; the timeline, commentary and per-match stat
endpoints plus every sync behind them stay, so no data path and no schema
changes with it.

